OL,3,AUkraine doesn't deserve 'respite',
OL,4,ARussia's Lavrov says, as Zelensky says
OL,5,Ahe'd support Trump's energy ceasefire
OL,6,
OL,7,FPresident Volodymyr Zelensky says
OL,8,FUkraine is willing to back an energy
OL,9,Fceasefire if Moscow does the same,
OL,10,Fadding it could "become a major step
OL,11,Ftoward ending the war"
OL,13,FHowever, he says Russia hit a power
OL,14,Fplant in Ukraine "immediately after"
OL,15,FDonald Trump announced on Sunday what
OL,16,Fhe called an energy ceasefire
OL,18,FRussia's foreign minister has said Kyiv
OL,19,Fdoesn't deserve the "respite" a
OL,20,Fceasefire would bring
OL,23,APub: 12-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
