OL,3,AUkraine doesn't deserve 'respite',
OL,4,ARussia's Lavrov says, as Zelensky says
OL,5,Ahe'd support Trump's energy ceasefire
OL,6,
OL,7,FEarlier when asked about an energy
OL,8,Ftruce, a Kremlin spokesman said: "As
OL,9,Fsoon as we have something to say on the
OL,10,Fmatter, we will inform you"
OL,12,FTrump has been urging Ukraine to stop
OL,13,Fstrikes on Russian oil infrastructure
OL,14,Fso Moscow can fulfil a recently struck
OL,15,Fdeal to release diesel to the US and
OL,16,Fthe global market
OL,18,FRussia has ramped up attacks on
OL,19,FUkrainian energy infrastructure every
OL,20,Fwinter since Vladimir Putin launched a
OL,21,Ffull-scale invasion in 2022
OL,23,APub: 12-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
